ht: 700; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Name of the Month</strong></td><td style=\"width: 38.7883%;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: monospace, monospace; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); display: inline !important;\">{<span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: monospace, monospace; font"}, {"slug": "155000004987-understanding-facebook-ad-reporting-terminology", "title": "Understanding Facebook Ad Reporting Terminology", "folder": "Ad Manager", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48248679006/original/j7gNWZUg6YZXVq1Mg8jEISwJrcXzBX9rkw6612.jpg?1662051755", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48248679004/original/YHkis7O-Ss55yhKo7tr9JUj5n4Kux_HdYQ6612.png?1662051755"], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<p class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-65daf798-5794-4ed5-9b59-001312594421\" data-identifyelement=\"559\" dir=\"ltr\">Facebook Ad Reporting provides live reporting and analysis for your client's digital ad campaigns. Facebook Ad Reporting provides big-picture campaign analysis, so it is easy to understand your client's ad performance and grow their ROI.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><h4 dir=\"ltr\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Covered in this article:</strong></span></h4><ul><li style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><h4><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"#Impressions\">Impressions</a></span></h4></li><li style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><h4><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"#Clicks\">Clicks</a></span></h4></li><li style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><h4><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"#Conversions\">Conversions</a></span></h4></li><li style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><h4><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"#Client-Spend\">Client Spend</a></span></h4></li><li style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><h4><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"#Average-CPC-(Cost-per-Click)\">Average CPC (Cost per Click)</a></span></h4></li><li style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><h4><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"#Cost-Per-Conversion-(CPA)\">Cost Per Conversion (CPA)</a></span></h4></li><li style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><h4><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"#Conversion-Rate\">Conversion Rate</a></span></h4></li><li style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><h4><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"#%E2%80%8BRevenue-%C2%A0\">Revenue &nbsp;</a></span></h4></li><li style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><h4><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"#ROI%C2%A0\">ROI&nbsp;</a></span></h4></li><li style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><h4><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"#Sales%C2%A0\">Sales&nbsp;</a></span></h4></li><li style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><h4><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"#CPS-(Cost-per-Sales)%C2%A0\">CPS (Cost per Sales)&nbsp;</a></span></h4></li><li style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><h4><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"#Leads%C2%A0\">Leads&nbsp;</a></span></h4></li><li><h4><a href=\"#CPL-(Cost-per-Lead)-\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">CPL (Cost per Lead)&nbsp;</span></a></h4></li></ul><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><hr><h2 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Impressions</strong></h2><p dir=\"ltr\">An impression is the number of times your ad is displayed on a search results page or another website within the Facebook network.</p><p><br></p><p><br><br data-identifyelement=\"570\"></p><h2 dir=\"ltr\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Clicks</strong></h2><p dir=\"ltr\">When someone clicks your Ad, like on the Blue Headline or Phone Number of a Text Ad, <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\">Facebook</span> Ads Counts That As A Click.</p><p><br><br></p><p><br></p><h2 dir=\"ltr\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Conversions</strong></h2><p dir=\"ltr\">A conversion is any interaction between a user and your website where the user completes an action that you\u2019ve defined as valuable to your business. For example, if I visit your site and view a specific webpage, that would be one type of conversion. If I download your eBook, sign up for your newsletter, or take another action, that would also be considered a conversion. The goal of conversions is to convert visitors into customers.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br data-identifyelement=\"587\"></p><p><br><br></p><h2 dir=\"ltr\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Client Spend</strong></h2><p dir=\"ltr\">It is the cost of running the ad plus the agencies management fees (This is <strong>only</strong> visible to <u dir=\"ltr\">Agency Admin and Agency User</u>)</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br><br></p><p><br></p><h2 dir=\"ltr\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Average CPC (Cost per Click)</strong></h2><p dir=\"ltr\">CPC is the average amount that a publisher pays for each click on their ad. The higher the CPC, the more expensive it will be to place an advertisement.</p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">The cost of placing an advertisement can vary depending on many factors such as:</p><ul><li>Advertiser\u2019s budget</li><li>Number of impressions</li><li>Location and time of day</li><li dir=\"ltr\">Type of content in which</li></ul><p><br><br><br data-identifyelement=\"603\"></p><h2 data-identifyelement=\"588\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Cost Per Conversion (CPA)</strong></h2><p data-identifyelement=\"590\" dir=\"ltr\">is a metric that measures the average cost of acquiring one new customer. It\u2019s also known as Cost per Acquisition, or CPA. It is calculated by dividing the total cost of ads by the total number of conversions.&nbsp;</p><p data-identifyelement=\"591\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding-top: 4px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"592\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><h2 data-identifyelement=\"593\" dir=\"ltr\"><br><strong dir=\"ltr\">Conversion Rate</strong></h2><p data-identifyelement=\"595\">Conversion rates are calculated by simply taking the number of conversions and dividing that by the number of total ad interactions that can be tracked to a conversion during the same time period. For example, if you had 50 conversions from 1,000 interactions, your conversion rate would be 5%, since 50 \u00f7 1,000 = 5%</p><p data-identifyelement=\"597\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding-top: 4px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"598\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><h2 data-identifyelement=\"599\" dir=\"ltr\"><br><strong>Revenue &nbsp;</strong></h2><p data-identifyelement=\"602\" dir=\"ltr\">When an opportunity is marked as won, the opportunity will have a Lead value (monetary) added. It is sum total of all the opportunity which is marked as won for a specific <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\">Facebook</span> ad campaign.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"602\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding-top: 4px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"602\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Please note:</strong></p><pre class=\"fd-callout fd-callout--note\" dir=\"ltr\">When adding a lead value <u><strong>only</strong></u> use numerical integers. There is no need to add a $ sign as its already accounted for in the field (See example below)</pre><p data-identifyelement=\"603\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding-top: 4px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"604\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><div class=\"image-container \" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><a class=\"image-enlarge-link\" href=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48241707307/original/n4Q9x-G_xbtco9dnWK_2SSKSBQOFNkLGUwe768.png?1659026778\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(51, 102, 187) !important; font-size: 16px !important; line-height: 20px !important;\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48248679006/original/j7gNWZUg6YZXVq1Mg8jEISwJrcXzBX9rkw6612.jpg?1662051755\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib lightbox-image\" data-id=\"48248679006\" data-index=\"0\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 98%; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; width: 433px; height: 508.277px; border: 0px !important;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></a></div><p><br></p><p data-identifyelement=\"607\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding-top: 4px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br><br data-identifyelement=\"608\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><h2 data-identifyelement=\"609\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong>ROI</strong><strong data-identifyelement=\"610\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp;</strong></h2><p data-identifyelement=\"611\" dir=\"ltr\">Return On Investment (ROI) is measured by calculating the ratio between the costs incurred during an advertising campaign and the revenues generated from that campaign. ROI can be applied to each individual ad, or to the entire page.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"611\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding-top: 4px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"612\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding-top: 4px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"613\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><h2 data-identifyelement=\"614\"><strong>Sales</strong>&nbsp;</h2><p data-identifyelement=\"616\">It refers to the leads/opportunities that have been marked as won.</p><div class=\"image-container \"><a class=\"image-enlarge-link\" href=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48247982025/original/jPd0Kh-Q6Sh4dMgRKaXkowGGiqjBND-vxg7694.png?1661809072\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(51, 102, 187) !important; font-size: 16px !important; line-height: 20px !important;\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48248679004/original/YHkis7O-Ss55yhKo7tr9JUj5n4Kux_HdYQ6612.png?1662051755\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib lightbox-image\" data-id=\"48248679004\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 98%; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; width: 430px; height: 586.771px; border: 0px !important;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></a></div><h2 data-identifyelement=\"619\" dir=\"ltr\"><br><strong>CPS (Cost per Sales)&nbsp;</strong></h2><p data-identifyelement=\"621\" dir=\"ltr\">CPS is measured by dividing the cost of running a specific campaign by the number of opportunities marked as won.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"622\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding-top: 4px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"623\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding-top: 4px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><h2 data-identifyelement=\"624\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Leads&nbsp;</strong></h2><p data-identifyelement=\"626\" dir=\"ltr\">It refers to the leads/opportunities that are recorded as open through form submission, response via chat widget, or phone call.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"627\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding-top: 4px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"628\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding-top: 4px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><h2 data-identifyelement=\"629\"><strong>CPL (Cost per Lead)&nbsp;</strong></h2><p data-identifyelement=\"631\" dir=\"ltr\">CPS is measured by dividing the cost of running a specific campaign by the number of opportunities that are in the open stage.</p>\n\t"}, {"slug": "48001221954-wordpress-error-codes-and-faq", "title": "WordPress Error Codes and FAQ", "folder": "WordPress Folder", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48250795731/original/d7yH5xdDd9jFFLRlaR3yBHFlFkcTvFaj9g95e6.png?1663090770", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48250795733/original/RhdvD81Y2v7hRmleOWoGrn10ozjxVBnwGg95e6.png?1663090770"], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<p data-identifyelement=\"556\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">Our WordPress Hosting system has a few error codes that are unique only to our system 