"font-size: 14px;\"><a data-identifyelement=\"1052\" href=\"#Q%3A-Is-there-a-limit-to-how-far-in-advance-I-can-schedule-recurring-posts?\"><span data-identifyelement=\"1053\" style=\"color: rgb(41, 105, 176);\">Q: Is there a limit to how far in advance I can schedule recurring posts?</span></a></span></h4></li><li class=\"tdfocus-1692203931321\" data-identifyelement=\"1054\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><h4 data-identifyelement=\"1055\"><span data-identifyelement=\"1056\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a data-identifyelement=\"1057\" href=\"#Q%3A-Will-Twitter's-repetitive-content-policy-affect-my-recurring-posts?\"><span data-identifyelement=\"1058\" style=\"color: rgb(41, 105, 176);\">Q: Will Twitter's repetitive content policy affect my recurring posts?</span></a></span></h4></li><li data-identifyelement=\"1059\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><h4 data-identifyelement=\"1060\"><span data-identifyelement=\"1061\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a data-identifyelement=\"1062\" href=\"#Q%3A-Can-I-pause-or-temporarily-stop-a-recurring-post-series?\"><span data-identifyelement=\"1063\" style=\"color: rgb(41, 105, 176);\">Q: Can I pause or temporarily stop a recurring post series?</span></a></span></h4></li><li class=\"tdfocus-1692203939373\" data-identifyelement=\"1064\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><h4 data-identifyelement=\"1065\"><span data-identifyelement=\"1066\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a data-identifyelement=\"1067\" href=\"#Q%3A-What-if-I-want-different-recurring-posts-for-different-social-platforms?\"><span data-identifyelement=\"1068\" style=\"color: rgb(41, 105, 176);\">Q: What if I want different recurring posts for different social platforms?</span></a></span></h4></li><li class=\"tdfocus-1692203943414\" data-identifyelement=\"1069\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><h4 data-identifyelement=\"1070\"><span data-identifyelement=\"1071\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a data-identifyelement=\"1072\" href=\"#Q%3A-Can-recurring-posts-be-part-of-a-larger-campaign-with-non-recurring-content?\"><span data-identifyelement=\"1073\" style=\"color: rgb(41, 105, 176);\">Q: Can recurring posts be part of a larger campaign with non-recurring content?</span></a></span></h4></li><li class=\"tdfocus-1692203947533\" data-identifyelement=\"1074\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><h4 data-identifyelement=\"1075\"><span data-identifyelement=\"1076\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a data-identifyelement=\"1077\" href=\"#Q%3A-How-can-I-ensure-my-recurring-posts-are-accessible-to-all-users,-including-those-with-disabilities?\"><span data-identifyelement=\"1078\" style=\"color: rgb(41, 105, 176);\">Q: How can I ensure my recurring posts are accessible to all users, including those with disabilities?</span></a></span></h4></li><li data-identifyelement=\"1079\"><h4 data-identifyelement=\"1080\"><a data-identifyelement=\"1081\" href=\"#Q%3A-How-do-I-avoid-making-recurring-posts-feel-too-automated-or-impersonal?\"><span data-identifyelement=\"1082\" style=\"color: rgb(41, 105, 176); font-size: 14px;\">Q: How do I avoid making recurring posts feel too automated or impersonal?</span></a></h4></li></ul></li></ul><p data-identifyelement=\"1083\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1084\"></p><hr data-identifyelement=\"1085\"><h2 class=\"tdfocus-1692201091611\" data-identifyelement=\"1086\" id=\"What-is-this-feature?\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1087\">What is this feature?</strong></h2><p class=\"tdfocus-1692269223238\" data-identifyelement=\"1088\"><br></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1692269223238\" data-identifyelement=\"1088\"><span class=\"fr-video fr-deletable fr-fvc fr-dvb fr-draggable\"><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/YZvZiMLxix4\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-forms allow-same-origin allow-presentation\"></iframe></span><br></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1692269223238\" data-identifyelement=\"1088\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1089\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"1090\">The recurring posts feature in the Social Planner is designed to help users maintain consistent and automated social media engagement by scheduling evergreen content regularly. Here's a detailed breakdown of how it works:</p><p data-identifyelement=\"1091\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1092\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"1093\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1094\">Flexible Scheduling:</strong> Users can set the posts to repeat every day, week, month, or year. They can select specific days of the week, date ranges, and post times according to their preferences.</p><p class=\"tdfocus-1692203448122\" data-identifyelement=\"1095\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1096\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"1097\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1098\">Content Creation:&nbsp;</strong>Users can generate quality content using AI, allowing them to create posts that resonate with their audience quickly.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"1099\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1100\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1692200628326\" data-identifyelement=\"1101\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1102\">Editing Options:</strong> The feature allows for edits to both parent and child posts. If changes are made to the parent post, they will be replicated in all child (scheduled) posts. Editing a child's post will not impact the parent's post.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"1103\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1104\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1692200650488\" data-identifyelement=\"1105\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1106\">Recurring Posts Tab:</strong> The parent post is added to the Recurring Posts tab once scheduled. Users can access the edit function to change all recurring posts' time and date ranges.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"1107\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1108\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1692200651244\" data-identifyelement=\"1109\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1110\">Scheduled Posts:&nbsp;</strong>Individual scheduled posts appear separately, and users can edit each as needed without affecting the others.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"1111\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1112\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"1113\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1114\">Platform Consideration:&nbsp;</strong>It's important to be mindful of the policies of specific social platforms. For example, Twitter may flag content as repetitive if the recurring post feature is used excessively.</p><p class=\"tdfocus-1692200657873\" data-identifyelement=\"1115\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1116\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"1117\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1118\">Long-term Strategy:</strong> This feature allows for creating long-term content strategies, helping businesses stay in front of their audience without manually posting content regularly.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"1119\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1120\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1692200666315\" data-identifyelement=\"1121\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1122\">Images and Media:</strong> Along with the text, users can add images or other media from their library or, through image AI, visually enrich the content.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"1123\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1124\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1692200668434\" data-identifyelement=\"1125\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1126\">Monitoring and Management:&nbsp;</strong>Users can track and manage all their recurring posts through a simple interface, providing control over their social media content.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"1127\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1128\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"1129\" dir=\"ltr\">The recurring posts feature empowers users to take a proactive and automated approach to social media management, ensuring a steady stream of fresh content without constant manual effort. It offers great flexibility and control, making it a powerful tool in a modern marketer's toolkit.</p><p class=\"tdfocus-1692201186799\" data-identifyelement=\"1130\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1131\"></p><h3 class=\"tdfocus-1692201186799\" data-identifyelement=\"1132\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Usage-Cases\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1133\">Usage Cases</strong></h3><p class=\"tdfocus-1692201233561\" data-identifyelement=\"1134\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1135\">Promoting Seasonal Offers:</strong> A retail store can set recurring posts to promote seasonal sales, offers, or specific products at the beginning of each season. They can easily plan this for the entire year and forget the manual posting process.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"1136\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1137\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"1138\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1139\">Daily Inspirational Quotes:</strong> A motivational speaker or life coach can schedule daily inspirational quotes to engage their audience and reinforce their brand messaging. This consistency helps in keeping the audience connected and engaged.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"1140\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1141\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"1142\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1143\">Weekly Tips or Tutorials:</strong> A tech company or educational platform can set up weekly tutorials or tips to share with their followers. This regular content provides value and helps establish the company as an expert.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"1144\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1145\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1692201267645\" data-identifyelement=\"1146\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1147\">Celebrating Recurring Events:</strong> A company can acknowledge and celebrate recurring events like employee birthdays, anniversaries, or national holidays, ensuring that these posts are never missed and adding a personal touch to the company's social media presence.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"1148\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1149\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1692201248598\" data-identifyelement=\"1150\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1151\">Monthly Product Showcases:</strong> A manufacturer or distributor can showcase different products every month, providing information, features, and benefits to educate potential customers.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"1152\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1153\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1692201252958\" data-identifyelement=\"1154\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1155\">Content Repurposing</strong>: For businesses with a rich content library (such as blogs or podcasts), recurring posts can periodically share or reshare this content to new followers or those who might have missed it the first time.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"1156\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1157\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1692201266126\" data-identifyelement=\"1158\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1159\">Reinforcing Brand Campaigns:</strong> If a company has a year-long brand campaign or slogan, recurring posts can consistently remind followers of the brand's core message, ensuring that it stays fresh in their minds.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"1160\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1161\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"1162\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1163\">Reminder for Regular Events:</strong> For organizations hosting regular events like webinars or community meet-ups, recurring posts can act as reminders, ensuring participants have the information they need to join.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"1164\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1165\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1692201276086\" data-identifyelement=\"1166\"><strong class=\"tdfocus-1692201277629\" data-identifyelement=\"1167\">Automating Social Engagement in Different Time Zones:</strong> For global businesses, recurring posts can schedule content at optimal times for different time zones, ensuring the content reaches the broadest possible audience.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"1168\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1169\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1692201272927\" data-identifyelement=\"1170\"><span data-identifyelement=\"1171\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1172\">Compliance and Regular Announcements:</strong></span> In industries where regular compliance updates or announcements are necessary, recurring posts can ensure that the necessary information is shared with stakeholders at the required intervals.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"1173\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1174\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1692201300734\" data-identifyelement=\"1175\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1176\">Celebrating Historical Milestones:</strong> Museums, historical societies, or educational institutions can use this feature to share historical facts or milestones on the corresponding dates, providing educational content to their followers.</p><hr data-identifyelement=\"1177\"><h2 class=\"tdfocus-1692201372519\" data-identifyelement=\"1178\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"How-to-use-this-feature?\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1179\">How to use this feature?</strong></h2><h3 class=\"tdfocus-1692201401734\" data-block-id=\"block-4c1ced42-9c73-4418-a726-e40a6b186c7a\" data-identifyelement=\"1180\" id=\"How-to-create-a-Recurring-Post?\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1181\">How to create a Recurring Post?</strong></h3><ul data-identifyelement=\"1182\"><li class=\"tdfocus-1692201409694\" data-identifyelement=\"1183\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\">Go to Marketing &gt; Social Planner.</li><li class=\"tdfocus-1692202191356\" data-identifyelement=\"1184\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\">Create a new post for social platform on which you would like to create content.<img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155005360512/original/PHGt93-Xp2G3Wpyb1EmMERia6KpXpuyEVQ2bb9.png?1692202201\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155005360512\" data-identifyelement=\"1185\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155005360578/original/Xtw5Tg6Zo6hR5fa-yntVaJ1FHAAHRA8HYQ4195.png?1692202257\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155005360578\" data-identifyelement=\"1186\"></li></ul><p class=\"tdfocus-1692201435246\" data-identifyelement=\"1187\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1188\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1692201435246\" data-identifyelement=\"1189\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1190\" dir=\"ltr\">Please Note:</strong></p><pre class=\"fd-callout fd-callout--note\" data-identifyelement=\"1191\">On Twitter, this content may be flagged as repetitive when compared to other social media platforms.</pre><p class=\"tdfocus-1692201435246\" data-identifyelement=\"1192\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1193\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1692202335546\" data-identifyelement=\"1194\">Create New Post with Recurring Schedule&nbsp;<img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155005360682/original/FrzOcKGOD049_fgkT4YoTtpUiB3Frue8aA30ad.png?1692202339\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155005360682\" data-identifyelement=\"1195\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1196\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1197\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1692201938965\" data-identifyelement=\"1198\" dir=\"ltr\">Day &nbsp;- The user will have to choose the date and time of posting on repeat everyday.<br class=\"Apple-interchange-newline\" data-identifyelement=\"1199\"><img class=\"ql-image fr-fic fr-dii\" src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155005360735/original/YyCVrOjjUXoT3LAXB5HH9FqViPcgwQhA-Q5d7e.png?1692202364\" data-id=\"155005360735\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-width: var(--cu-border-size-1); border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(240, 241, 243); border-image: initial; max-width: calc(100% - 5px); cursor: pointer; padding: 0px; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; color: rgb(42, 46, 52); border-radius: var(--cu-radii-2);\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-identifyelement=\"1200\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1201\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1202\">Week - Users will have to choose the day of the week when they would like to repeat schedule between the date range and post time.<br data-identifyelement=\"1203\"><img class=\"ql-image fr-fic fr-dii\" src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155005359267/original/Js0EKCD3ei5VwLgzDu0v4pwIsf2DU60rKgbb7b.png?1692201380\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155005359267\" data-identifyelement=\"1204\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1205\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1206\">Month - The user will have to choose the date and time of posting on repeat once in a month.<br data-identifyelement=\"1207\"><img class=\"ql-image fr-fic fr-dii\" src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155005359266/original/llSb4F3x6ixHRmu_89LpjBflWuj55r1EAQbb7b.png?1692201380\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(42, 46, 52); padding: 0px; border-width: var(--cu-border-size-1); border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(240, 241, 243); border-image: initial; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; cursor: pointer; max-width: 100%; border-radius: var(--cu-radii-2);\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155005359266\" data-identifyelement=\"1208\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1209\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1210\">Year -The user will have to choose the date and time of posting on repeat once in the year.<br data-identifyelement=\"1211\"><img class=\"ql-image fr-fic fr-dii\" src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155005359268/original/2TGzp4rcRjLfXC04ZOZ1FG7opCtqO89SPwbb7b.png?1692201380\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(42, 46, 52); padding: 0px; border-width: var(--cu-border-size-1); border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(240, 241, 243); border-image: initial; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; cursor: pointer; max-width: 100%; border-radius: var(--cu-radii-2);\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155005359268\" data-identifyelement=\"1212\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1213\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"1214\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(42, 46, 52);\" data-identifyelement=\"1215\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1692202395092\" data-identifyelement=\"1216\" dir=\"ltr\">Once the recurring post is scheduled, the parent post will be added in the Recurring Posts tab with the edit function to change the time and date range. For example, if four posts are scheduled using a recurring post, the parent post will show in recurring post and one post will appear in the scheduled post.&nbsp;<img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155005361434/original/lJvjXlopKNmkDcYiuh1DMl_zbXHjYHIMRgbc09.png?1692202779\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155005361434\" data-identifyelement=\"1217\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1692202773649\" data-identifyelement=\"1218\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(42, 46, 52);\" data-identifyelement=\"1219\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1692201831913\" data-identifyelement=\"1220\" dir=\"ltr\">If you change the content on the parent post, it will replicate in the child's scheduled post. If you change child-scheduled post content, it will not impact the parent post.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"1221\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1222\"></p><h3 class=\"tdfocus-1692201831913\" data-identifyelement=\"1223\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Important-things-to-note:\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1224\">Important things to note:</strong></h3><p data-identifyelement=\"1225\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1226\">Avoid Repetitiveness:</strong> Though recurring posts can save time, please ensure content isn't overly repetitive, especially on platforms like Twitter that might flag it as spam. Variation and customization can make each post feel fresh.</p><p class=\"tdfocus-1692202052314\" data-identifyelement=\"1227\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1228\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"1229\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1230\">Review Regularly:</strong> Please review and update recurring posts regularly to ensure relevance, especially if there have been changes to products, offers, or brand messaging.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"1231\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1232\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"1233\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1234\">Consider Audience Engagement:</strong> Please note that interaction from followers might differ across various posts. Monitoring and responding to these interactions can provide insight and maintain engagement.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"1235\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1236\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"1237\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1238\">Compliance with Platform Policies:</strong> Different social media platforms have different policies regarding recurring and automated posts. Please be aware of and comply with each platform's guidelines to avoid potential issues.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"1239\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1240\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"1241\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1242\">Utilize Rich Media:</strong> Images, videos, or GIFs can make recurring posts more engaging. Please consider integrating rich media into the content to grab attention.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"1243\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1244\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1692202071745\" data-identifyelement=\"1245\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1246\">Time Zone Considerations:</strong> If targeting a global audience, please consider scheduling posts according to the different time zones of your target demographics to maximize reach.</p><p class=\"tdfocus-1692202075433\" data-identifyelement=\"1247\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1248\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1692202079345\" data-identifyelement=\"1249\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1250\">Content Backup:</strong> Please ensure a backup of all recurring content. Any technical issues could lead to loss of content, and having a backup will prevent unnecessary work in recreating it.</p><p class=\"tdfocus-1692202080547\" data-identifyelement=\"1251\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1252\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"1253\"><strong class=\"tdfocus-1692202093541\" data-identifyelement=\"1254\">Monitoring Performance:</strong> Please note that analyzing the performance of recurring posts helps understand what resonates with the audience. Regularly monitoring insights can guide future content strategy.</p><p class=\"tdfocus-1692202087988\" data-identifyelement=\"1255\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1256\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"1257\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1258\">Avoiding Over-Scheduling:</strong> While it's tempting to schedule a lot of content in advance, please avoid over-scheduling, as it may lead to a lack of spontaneity and real-time engagement with your audience.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"1259\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1260\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"1261\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1262\">Sensitive Issues and Crisis Management:</strong> Please be cautious with recurring posts during sensitive times or crises. Scheduled posts that may be inappropriate during unexpected events must be reviewed and managed accordingly.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"1263\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1264\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"1265\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1266\">Integration with Other Campaigns:&nbsp;</strong>If ongoing or planned marketing campaigns exist, please ensure that the recurring posts align with the overall marketing and branding strategies.</p><p class=\"tdfocus-1692202111497\" data-identifyelement=\"1267\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1268\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"1269\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1270\">Accessibility Considerations:</strong> Please include accessible content, such as video captions or alternative text for images, to ensure that all followers, including those with disabilities, can engage with the posts.</p><p class=\"tdfocus-1692202816947\" data-identifyelement=\"1271\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1272\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"1273\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1274\">Legal and Ethical Considerations:</strong> Please be mindful of intellectual property rights, permissions, and other legal considerations when using images, quotes, or other content within recurring posts.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"1275\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1276\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1692202606404\" data-identifyelement=\"1277\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1278\">Experiment and Iterate:</strong> Recurring posts are a tool, and like any tool, they require experimentation to find the most effective way to use them. Please don't be afraid to try different strategies and iterate based on what you learn.</p><hr data-identifyelement=\"1279\"><h2 class=\"tdfocus-1692202618592\" data-identifyelement=\"1280\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"FAQs\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1281\">FAQs</strong></h2><h3 class=\"tdfocus-1692202805591\" data-identifyelement=\"1282\" id=\"Q:-Can-I-set-recurring-posts-for-specific-holidays-or-annual-events?\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1283\">Q: Can I set recurring posts for specific holidays or annual events?</strong></h3><p data-identifyelement=\"1284\">A: Yes, you can schedule recurring posts for specific dates, allowing you to automate posts for holidays or annual events like company anniversaries.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"1285\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1286\"></p><h3 class=\"tdfocus-1692202810885\" data-identifyelement=\"1287\" id=\"Q:-What-happens-if-I-edit-the-parent-post-of-a-recurring-schedule?\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1288\">Q: What happens if I edit the parent post of a recurring schedule?</strong></h3><p class=\"tdfocus-1692202811247\" data-identifyelement=\"1289\" dir=\"ltr\">A: Editing the parent post will replicate the changes in child scheduled posts. However, changes made to individual child posts will not affect the parent post.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"1290\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1291\"></p><h3 data-identifyelement=\"1292\" id=\"Q:-Can-I-mix-media-types,-like-images-and-videos,-in-my-recurring-posts?\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1293\">Q: Can I mix media types, like images and videos, in my recurring posts?</strong></h3><p data-identifyelement=\"1294\">A: Yes, you can include various media types, such as images, videos, or GIFs, within the recurring posts to make them more engaging.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"1295\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1296\"></p><h3 data-identifyelement=\"1297\" id=\"Q:-How-does-the-recurring-post-feature-interact-with-different-time-zones?\"><strong class=\"tdfocus-1692202835687\" data-identifyelement=\"1298\">Q: How does the recurring post feature interact with different time zones?</strong></h3><p data-identifyelement=\"1299\">A: You'll need to set the time for your recurring posts considering the time zone of your target audience. Be mindful of global audiences if applicable.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"1300\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1301\"></p><h3 class=\"tdfocus-1692202849299\" data-identifyelement=\"1302\" id=\"Q:-Is-there-a-limit-to-how-far-in-advance-I-can-schedule-recurring-posts?\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1303\">Q: Is there a limit to how far in advance I can schedule recurring posts?</strong></h3><p data-identifyelement=\"1304\">A: Depending on the specific settings and platform guidelines, you may be able to schedule recurring posts for days, weeks, months, or even years in advance.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"1305\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1306\"></p><h3 data-identifyelement=\"1307\" id=\"Q:-Will-Twitter's-repetitive-content-policy-affect-my-recurring-posts?\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1308\">Q: Will Twitter's repetitive content policy affect my recurring posts?</strong></h3><p class=\"tdfocus-1692202942755\" data-identifyelement=\"1309\" dir=\"ltr\">A: Yes, Twitter might flag recurring posts as repetitive content. It's essential to be mindful of this and create variations in content to comply with Twitter's policies.<a class=\"tdfocus-1692203967609\" data-identifyelement=\"1310\" href=\"https://help.twitter.com/en/rules-and-policies/copypasta-duplicate-content\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">&nbsp;<span data-identifyelement=\"1311\" style=\"color: rgb(41, 105, 176);\">Click here</span></a> for more details.</p><p class=\"tdfocus-1692202701748\" data-identifyelement=\"1312\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1313\"></p><h3 class=\"tdfocus-1692202702232\" data-identifyelement=\"1314\" id=\"Q:-Can-I-pause-or-temporarily-stop-a-recurring-post-series?\"><strong class=\"tdfocus-1692203115150\" data-identifyelement=\"1315\">Q: Can I pause or temporarily stop a recurring post series?</strong></h3><p class=\"tdfocus-1692202700799\" data-identifyelement=\"1316\" dir=\"ltr\">A: You cannot pause or temporarily stop a recurring post series</p><p class=\"tdfocus-1692203215861\" data-identifyelement=\"1317\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1318\"></p><h3 data-identifyelement=\"1319\" id=\"Q:-What-if-I-want-different-recurring-posts-for-different-social-platforms?\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1320\">Q: What if I want different recurring posts for different social platforms?</strong></h3><p class=\"tdfocus-1692203093502\" data-identifyelement=\"1321\" dir=\"ltr\">A: You can create unique recurring posts tailored to each social platform using the Customize Each Post functionality, allowing you to align the content with each network's specific character limits and guidelines.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"1322\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1323\"></p><h3 data-identifyelement=\"1324\" id=\"Q:-Can-recurring-posts-be-part-of-a-larger-campaign-with-non-recurring-content?\"><strong class=\"tdfocus-1692203139418\" data-identifyelement=\"1325\">Q: Can recurring posts be part of a larger campaign with non-recurring content?</strong></h3><p class=\"tdfocus-1692203140154\" data-identifyelement=\"1326\" dir=\"ltr\">A: Absolutely! You can integrate recurring posts with other marketing strategies and campaigns to create a cohesive and consistent brand message.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"1327\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1328\"></p><h3 class=\"tdfocus-1692203188378\" data-identifyelement=\"1329\" id=\"Q:-How-can-I-ensure-my-recurring-posts-are-accessible-to-all-users,-including-those-with-disabilities?\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1330\">Q: How can I ensure my recurring posts are accessible to all users, including those with disabilities?</strong></h3><p data-identifyelement=\"1331\">A: Incorporating accessibility features like captions, alt text, and other inclusive practices can make your recurring posts accessible to a broader audience.</p><p class=\"tdfocus-1692203335688\" data-identifyelement=\"1332\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1333\"></p><h3 data-identifyelement=\"1334\" id=\"Q:-How-do-I-avoid-making-recurring-posts-feel-too-automated-or-impersonal?\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1335\">Q: How do I avoid making recurring posts feel too automated or impersonal?</strong></h3><p data-identifyelement=\"1336\" dir=\"ltr\">A: Mixing recurring posts with real-time, personalized content and engaging with your audience can help maintain a human touch in your social media presence.</p><p class=\"tdfocus-1692203855226\" data-identifyelement=\"1337\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1338\"></p>\n\t"}, {"slug": "155000003876-trigger-a-workflow-within-conversation-ai", "title": "Trigger a Workflow within Conversation AI", "folder": "Conversation AI", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155034819033/original/lEYra8fbZTkLdz0MasXnRWbeZbURIHjslA3bb2.png?1729086506", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155034819035/original/LdIujos30rowDFRpOwQdzbyB6Xdby9iIyA3bb2.png?1729086506", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155034819745/original/blJLG21izNXSEKi9hQOFfp2Wbj1HBUQYNwc2f4.png?1729086898", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155034820562/original/nyeAOZKAO85ArgxDXRPegB04hSWvuOVkpg8734.png?1729087255", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155034821503/original/ahxCliLVT3VLWBCOKbBAMmOVLMCgQIwA1g503a.png?1729087801"], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<p class=\"fd-toc\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">TABLE OF CONTENTS</strong></p><ul><li><a href=\"#Introduction\">Introduction</a></li><li><a href=\"#Step-1%3A-Once-you're-in-the-Bot-Goals-tab,-click-on-the-Trigger-a-workflow-button-to-explore-the-details\">Step 1: Once you're in the Bot Goals tab, click on the Trigger a workflow button to explore the details</a></li><li><a href=\"#Step-2%3A-Click-on-Trigger-a-workflow-button-and-update-the-required-details%C2%A0\">Step 2: Click on Trigger a workflow button and update the required details&nbsp;</a><ul><li><a href=\"#How-to-Set-Up-the-Fields\">How to Set Up the Fields</a></li></ul></li></ul><h2 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Introduction\"><strong><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Introduction</span></strong></h2><p dir=\"ltr\">The <strong>Trigger a Workflow</strong> feature allows users to automate specific actions by linking workflows within the AI conversation. When a defined condition is met during a customer interaction, the AI bot automatically triggers the selected workflow. This helps streamline operations, improve user experience, and achieve desired outcomes without requiring users to manually input all conditions in the prompt. Here's a step-by-step guide to using this feature</p><h2 data-identifyelement=\"523\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.4; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; text-indent: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-align: left;\"><br></h2><h2 data-identifyelement=\"523\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Step-1:-Once-you're-in-the-Bot-Goals-tab,-click-on-the-Trigger-a-workflow-button-to-explore-the-details\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.4; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Step 1: Once you're in the Bot Goals tab, click on the Trigger a workflow button to explore the details</strong></span></h2><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><pre class=\"fd-callout fd-callout--note\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; overflow: visible; font-family: monospace, monospace; font-size: 1em; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: normal; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 12px 16px; border-width: 1px 1px 1px 6px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(235, 237, 240) rgb(235, 237, 240) rgb(235, 237, 240) rgb(232, 111, 37); border-image: initial; border-radius: 8px 4px 4px 8px;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"522\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\">If you are creating a new bot, you need to edit the Bot name or assign&nbsp;a new name before accessing the feature</span></strong></pre><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"522\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155034819033/original/lEYra8fbZTkLdz0MasXnRWbeZbURIHjslA3bb2.png?1729086506\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib fr-bordered inline-image\" data-id=\"155034819033\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; padding: 0px 1px; width: 638px;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></span></strong></p><p class=\"fd-toc\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155034819035/original/LdIujos30rowDFRpOwQdzbyB6Xdby9iIyA3bb2.png?1729086506\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib fr-bordered inline-image\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; width: 638px;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155034819035\"></strong></p><p data-identifyelement=\"523\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: left;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155034819745/original/blJLG21izNXSEKi9hQOFfp2Wbj1HBUQYNwc2f4.png?1729086898\" style=\"width: 638px; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib fr-bordered\" data-id=\"155034819745\"></p><p class=\"fd-toc\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><br></p><h2 class=\"fd-toc\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Step-2:-Click-on-Trigger-a-workflow-button-and-update-the-required-details&nbsp;\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\">Step 2: Click on Trigger a workflow button and update the required details&nbsp;</span></strong></h2><h3 id=\"How-to-Set-Up-the-Fields\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 30.63px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.17em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">How to Set Up the Fields</h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">Follow these steps to set up and configure your workflow trigger:</p><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><li data-identifyelement=\"523\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: left;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Action Name:</strong> Assign an action name of your choice. This will help you easily identify the workflow later. For example you can name it, \"Subscription Workflow\".</li><li data-identifyelement=\"523\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: left;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Select a published workflow to trigger:</strong> From the dropdown menu, choose the workflow you want to trigger. Ensure that the workflow has been published beforehand. This is the workflow that will be triggered when the specified condition is met.</li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">When to trigger a workflow:&nbsp;</strong>In the third field, provide a short description of the condition that will trigger the workflow. This is important for the AI to know when to activate the workflow. Here are some examples:<ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">If you want to trigger a workflow when the customer wants to purchase your subscription, you could write: \"Customer wants to purchase the subscription\"</li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">If you want to trigger a workflow when the customer wants book an appointment, you could write: \"Customer wants to book an appointment\"</li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">This description helps the AI recognise the condition and trigger the workflow accordingly when a similar scenario occurs during the conversation.</li></ul></li><li data-identifyelement=\"523\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: left;\">Once you're done, click <strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Save</strong> to finalise the settings.</li><li data-identifyelement=\"523\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: left;\">By following these steps, the bot will automatically trigger the specified workflow whenever the defined condition arises, streamlining the process and improving customer interaction.</li></ul><p data-identifyelement=\"523\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: left;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155034820562/original/nyeAOZKAO85ArgxDXRPegB04hSWvuOVkpg8734.png?1729087255\" style=\"width: 644px; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155034820562\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"523\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: left;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155034821503/original/ahxCliLVT3VLWBCOKbBAMmOVLMCgQIwA1g503a.png?1729087801\" style=\"width: 645px; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-id=\"155034821503\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"523\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: left;\"><br></p><h2 dir=\"ltr\"><strong><u><span style=\"color: rgb(226, 80, 65);\">Important Notes for Using Trigger Conditions</span></u></strong></h2><ol><li><p><strong>Crafting Effective Trigger Conditions</strong>:<br>When defining trigger conditions like <strong>\"Customer wants to pay for a subscription\"</strong> or <strong>\"Customer wants to book an appointment\"</strong>, ensure the prompt is written in a way that:</p><ul><li>The bot naturally leads the conversation to ask related questions.</li><li>The customer's response aligns with the trigger condition.<br>For example, if the condition is <strong>\"Customer wants to book an appointment\"</strong>, structure the prompt so that the bot asks <strong>\"Would you like to book an appointment?\"</strong> or similar, encouraging the condition to arise naturally in the conversation.</li></ul></li><li><p><strong>Handling Duplicate Trigger Conditions</strong>:<br>If a trigger condition matches multiple simultaneous conditions (e.g., <strong>update contact info</strong> and <strong>trigger a workflow</strong>), the AI will determine which action to execute. For instance:</p><ul><li><strong>Update Contact Info</strong>: Updates the date of birth when the user provides their DOB.</li><li><strong>Trigger a Workflow</strong>: Triggers a workflow when the user provides their DOB.<br>In such cases, the execution depends on the AI\u2019s prioritization, as both conditions share the same trigger.</li></ul></li><li><p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Triggering Conditions from Bot or User Responses</strong>:<br>A trigger condition can be activated based on responses from either the bot or the user. This flexibility ensures that workflows can be triggered regardless of whether the condition arises from the bot leading the conversation or the user initiating it.</p></li><li><p dir=\"ltr\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Avoid Duplicating the trigger condition for same bot</strong></p></li></ol><p><br></p><p><br></p>\n\t"}, {"slug": "155000004172-clio-integration", "title": "Clio Integration", "folder": "Other Integrations", "images": [], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<h2 data-identifyelement=\"509\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"510\" dir=\"ltr\">Overview</strong>&nbsp;</h2><p data-identifyelement=\"511\" dir=\"ltr\">The Clio integration combines your CRM's marketing automation with Clio\u2019s legal practice management, allowing law firms to boost client engagement, improve online visibility, and streamline operations. With this integration, your firm can manage client communications, automate reviews, and improve your SEO, making it easier to attract and retain clients.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"512\" dir=\"ltr\"><br data-identifyelement=\"513\"></p><h2 data-identifyelement=\"514\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"515\" dir=\"ltr\">What is Clio?</strong></h2><p data-identifyelement=\"516\" dir=\"ltr\"><a data-identifyelement=\"517\" href=\"https://www.clio.com/\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Clio</a> is a cloud-based legal practice management software designed to help law firms streamline their operations and improve productivity. It offers features such as case management, time tracking, billing, document management, and client communication tools. Clio aims to simplify and automate administrative tasks, allowing lawyers to focus more on delivering quality legal services.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"518\" dir=\"ltr\"><br data-identifyelement=\"519\"></p><h2 data-identifyelement=\"520\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"521\" dir=\"ltr\">Key Benefits of the Integration</strong></h2><ol data-identifyelement=\"522\"><li><p data-identifyelement=\"524\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"525\" dir=\"ltr\">Automated Clientss Sync</strong><br>Sync clients from Clio to your CRM automatically. Nurture, convert and reactive contacts using Workflows, Conversations, etc. within your CRM.</p></li><li data-identifyelement=\"523\"><p data-identifyelement=\"524\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"525\" dir=\"ltr\">Automated Review Requests</strong><br data-identifyelement=\"526\">Request reviews automatically from clients, helping build a stronger online reputation. By integrating with Clio, you can ensure reviews are requested promptly at strategic points in the client journey.</p></li><li data-identifyelement=\"527\"><p data-identifyelement=\"528\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"529\" dir=\"ltr\">Enhanced SEO Visibility</strong><br data-identifyelement=\"530\">Your firm can automatically update over 60 essential web directories, optimizing your online presence. This improved SEO increases the likelihood that potential clients will find you in search results.</p></li><li data-identifyelement=\"531\"><p data-identifyelement=\"532\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"533\" dir=\"ltr\">Unified Communication</strong><br data-identifyelement=\"534\">Real-time messaging across multiple platforms (such as SMS, Google, your website, and social media) allows you to manage and respond to client inquiries more effectively, all through your CRM's unified chat interface.</p></li><li data-identifyelement=\"531\"><p data-identifyelement=\"532\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Calendar Sync</strong><br>Sync calendars two way between Clio and your CRM. </p></li></ol><p data-identifyelement=\"535\"><br data-identifyelement=\"536\"></p><h2 data-identifyelement=\"537\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"538\" dir=\"ltr\">Steps to Integrate with Clio</strong></h2><h4 data-identifyelement=\"539\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"540\" dir=\"ltr\">Step 1: Connect with Clio</strong></h4><ul data-identifyelement=\"541\"><li data-identifyelement=\"542\" dir=\"ltr\">Access the integrations settings page.</li><li data-identifyelement=\"543\" dir=\"ltr\">Choose Clio from the list of available integrations and follow the instructions to connect your accounts.</li><li data-identifyelement=\"544\" dir=\"ltr\">Grant permissions as needed to allow data to flow between the CRM and Clio seamlessly.</li></ul><h4 data-identifyelement=\"545\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"546\" dir=\"ltr\">Step 2: Enable review requests</strong></h4><ul data-identifyelement=\"547\"><li data-identifyelement=\"548\" dir=\"ltr\">Select the field 'Send Review' dropdown option in the Clio card if you wish to send reviews</li></ul><p data-identifyelement=\"550\"><br data-identifyelement=\"551\"></p><h4 data-identifyelement=\"545\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"546\" dir=\"ltr\">Step 3: Customize Workflows</strong></h4><ul data-identifyelement=\"547\"><li data-identifyelement=\"548\" dir=\"ltr\">Set up automated workflows to trigger actions based on your clients' progress in Clio.</li><li data-identifyelement=\"549\" dir=\"ltr\">Configure review requests, chat responses, and automated follow-ups as per your firm\u2019s needs.</li></ul><p data-identifyelement=\"550\"><br data-identifyelement=\"551\"></p><h2 data-identifyelement=\"552\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"553\" dir=\"ltr\">Using the Integration for Your Law Firm</strong></h2><p dir=\"ltr\">The following events are tied to the <a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"https://help.clio.com/hc/en-us/articles/9285920226075-Clio-Manage-Matters-Overview\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Matter</a> in Clio. These actions are triggered when changes are saved within a matter.</p><ul data-identifyelement=\"554\"><li data-identifyelement=\"555\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"560\" dir=\"ltr\">Streamline Review Collection:</strong> Automatically collect reviews post-case, building your online reputation. To do this, check \"Send Review\" in your <a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"https://help.clio.com/hc/en-us/articles/9285920226075-Clio-Manage-Matters-Overview\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Matter</a>'s <a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"https://help.clio.com/hc/en-150/articles/9285496802331-Create-Custom-Fields\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Custom Fields</a>.</li><li data-identifyelement=\"561\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Calendar Sync:&nbsp;</strong>Sync calendar events two-way between Clio and your CRM.</li><li data-identifyelement=\"561\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"562\" dir=\"ltr\">Centralize Messaging:</strong> Manage all client messages in one place, ensuring timely responses and a professional client experience.</li><li data-identifyelement=\"561\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Sync Clients</strong>: Client details are synced automatically with your CRM when you create/update Matters.</li></ul><p dir=\"ltr\">In addition, the integration also supports the following features that are native to :</p><ul><li data-identifyelement=\"557\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"558\" dir=\"ltr\">Monitor and Improve SEO:</strong> This integration will manage your listings across directories to improve visibility.</li><li dir=\"ltr\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"556\" dir=\"ltr\">Automate Client Communications:</strong> Create custom workflows to send reminders, updates, and follow-up messages automatically.</li></ul><p data-identifyelement=\"563\" dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><h2 data-identifyelement=\"571\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"572\" dir=\"ltr\">Troubleshooting and Support</strong></h2><p data-identifyelement=\"573\" dir=\"ltr\">If you encounter any issues during setup, Clio and your CRM both offer support resources. Visit the <a data-identifyelement=\"574\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_new\">Clio&nbsp;Help&nbsp;Center</a> or reach out to our support team for additional assistance.</p><hr data-identifyelement=\"575\"><p data-identifyelement=\"576\" dir=\"ltr\">With the Clio integration, your law firm can automate essential tasks, improve client engagement, and ultimately provide a better client experience. Integrating these platforms will streamline your operations and set your firm up for greater growth.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"577\"><br data-identifyelement=\"578\"></p>\n\t"}, {"slug": "155000006601-conversation-ai-multiple-calendars-support-for-appointment-booking", "title": "Conversation AI: Multiple Calendars Support for Appointment Booking", "folder": "Conversation AI", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155055564957/original/fT6FSf_9wdRADpBcqPcj9tpI77plSNsGfAd0cc.jpg?1759968550", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155055564961/original/hr6YX6iImz1i4cG8QpT9cueJmjXHuvhiVwd0cc.jpg?1759968550", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155055564956/original/f6jHPu44zEmOUsZl55M73x3LcGAhRigVHgd0cc.jpg?1759968550", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155055564959/original/nlY-4HcksGD2ou0IlSUL84A7dqT3SYpBPA36a9.jpg?1759968551", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155055564962/original/SV19BDG2S73CwmvR8ea3llVrSU1LnyC85g36a9.jpg?1759968551", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155055564960/original/VpVsXudEANf5hC5Yv_DI77SdDIqi3eSAeg36a9.jpg?1759968551", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155055564958/original/rQemIfuJtHMhCXKor_9hXfUoxCN02JlTJA36a9.jpg?1759968551", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155055564955/original/isBBn4_4VcEUeQ0_igaCpsiD3FWrit2y1Qa40e.jpg?1759968549"], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<p class=\"p3\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">This capability enables AI bots to intelligently detect and book appointments across <strong>multiple</strong> calendars, simplifying multi-specialty or multi-department scheduling for your business.</p><hr><p></p><h2 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">What is Multiple Calendars Support?</strong></h2><p class=\"p2\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">Multiple Calendars Support allows your AI Appointment Booking Bot to route booking requests to the correct calendar based on the customer\u2019s intent. Instead of limiting your bot to a single calendar, you can now configure several calendars\u2014each representing a service, department, or specialist\u2014and let the AI automatically determine which one to use.</p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">This feature is available under <span class=\"s2\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Conversation AI \u2192 Appointment Booking Bot Goal</strong></span> when setting up or editing an appointment booking flow.</p><hr><p></p><h2 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Key Benefits of Multiple Calendars Support</strong></h2><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><li class=\"p1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Smart Calendar Detection:</strong></span> The AI automatically matches user requests to the most appropriate calendar based on descriptions and keywords.</li></ul><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><li class=\"p1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Effortless Multi-Department Booking:</strong></span> Manage appointments for different teams or services (e.g., Cardiology, Neurology, Physiotherapy) within one AI bot.</li></ul><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><li class=\"p1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Fallback Calendar Assurance:</strong></span> Ensure no booking is missed by setting a default fallback calendar for unmatched requests.</li></ul><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><li class=\"p1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Seamless Workflow Integration:</strong></span> Supports all previous workflow triggers (cancel, reschedule, post-booking automation) used with single-calendar booking.</li></ul><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px